    "body": "@andytom Oh could be that! I actually omitted all the disabled modules.\r\n\r\nFind the full configuration:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"$all\"\r\n\r\n[cmd_duration]\r\nmin_time = 1000\r\nshow_milliseconds = true\r\nshow_notifications = true\r\nmin_time_to_notify = 15000\r\nnotification_timeout = 1000\r\n\r\n[character]\r\nerror_symbol = \"[❯](bold red)\"\r\nsuccess_symbol = \"[❯](bold green)\"\r\nvicmd_symbol = \"[V](bold blue)\"\r\n\r\n[python]\r\ndetect_extensions = []\r\nsymbol = \" \"\r\nstyle = \"yellow\"\r\n\r\n[git_status]\r\nmodified = \"*\"\r\n\r\n[git_metrics]\r\ndisabled = false\r\n\r\n[git_branch]\r\nsymbol = \" \"\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\nread_only = \" \"\r\nread_only_style = \"yellow\"\r\n\r\n[line_break]\r\ndisabled = false\r\n\r\n[sudo]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nsymbol = \"🦸 \"\r\n\r\n# DISABLED \r\n\r\n[hostname]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[localip]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[username]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[kubernetes]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[hg_branch]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[package]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[cmake]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[dart]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[deno]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[dotnet]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[elixir]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[elm]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[erlang]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[golang]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[helm]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[java]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[julia]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[kotlin]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[nim]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[nodejs]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[ocaml]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[perl]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[php]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[purescript]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[red]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[ruby]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[rust]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[scala]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[swift]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[terraform]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[vlang]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[vagrant]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[zig]\r\ndisabled = true\r\n\r\n[nix_shell]\r\nd