    "updated_at": "2022-04-23T09:29:39Z",
    "body": "So this error comes from\n\n```toml\n[custom]\ndisabled = true \n```\n\nYou can remove it and that will fix the problem. This is because we did some refactoring to the custom module in the most recent version, having a single custom block is not expected you would normally have something like\n\n```toml\n[custom.example]\ndisabled = true\ncommand = \"echo example\"\nwhen = true\n\n[custom.another]\ndisabled = false\ncommand = \"echo another\"\nwhen = true\n```",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
